The harness grades the app's chat agent with five checks (checks.ts:1-25).
Two read nothing but words and a record, and so read a call transcript as
well as a chat thread:

  provenance   every digit-run an agent says is in the borrower's own words
               or the record (checks.ts, section (1));
  verbatim     no agent message is a copy-library template pasted whole
               (checks.ts, section (2)).

The other three read the chat product's own tables (the turn log, the
cards, the events) and have no counterpart on a call.

